⭐ Interview Tip

The expected solution is the Stack approach. Every opening bracket is pushed onto the stack, and every closing bracket must match the most recent unmatched opening bracket. If a mismatch occurs or the stack becomes empty too early, the string is invalid. If the stack is empty after processing all characters, the parentheses are balanced. This gives an O(n) time and O(n) space solution.
